Lead in Prison","altTitle":"I Met the Male Lead in Prison (2023)","description":"I met the male lead in the prison. I know he's supposed to be a 19+ tragedy novel male lead, but... Why is he like that?\n\n\"Woof! Woof! Woof! Grrr.\"\n\nIt was said that he was cursed to turn into a beast... So, what is it like to awaken from the curse?\n\n\"T-t-take responsibility, or d-don't touch me!\"\n\nI just felt relieved, thinking there wouldn't be any romantic feelings or involvement between me and the male lead.\n\n\"One year later. P-please meet me... on the day I get out of here!\"\n\nMeeting him didn't seem too difficult, so I agreed. So I was released first, but...\n\n**\n\n”Come on in. My lovely little sister who's as charming as the flower.\"\n\nOn the day I was released, the man who approached me turned out to be my brother.\nI was the villain's sister.\n\n\"You went through a lot on my behalf, didn't you? I've been waiting for you.\"\n\n…Fuck. On top of it all, I’m the precious little sister of the villain who is the male lead’s nemesis?\n\n**\n\nThree years later, when we met again, the male lead smiled with a completely different face.\n\n\"Hello, Iyana. I'm going to kidnap you from now on.\"","year":2023,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Isekai","Drama","Fantasy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/dc07afaa-643a-4bf4-a9d0-b21ecc101736/9a73fd90-5e32-4284-b2ed-170119adbb8f.png.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["es-la","fr","en","pl"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":8.53,"follows":1839,"listAt":"2026-10-19T19:04:03.855Z","chapters":[{"id":"88fe2954-5fe9-4d05-bcfa-da19f9a74beb","number":"14","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":16,"createdAt":"2024-01-06T23:45:33+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"a9c35b86-881d-482e-8114-be2d75b66969","number":"13","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":17,"createdAt":"2023-12-25T18:50:14+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"54069c3d-0501-4528-860a-20ae5bbd4b35",